  "summary": "Malicious code in node-internal-svg-loader (npm)",
  "details": "The package exports functions that claim to fetch SVG icons from CDN providers, but on load it immediately makes HTTP requests to rest-icon-handler[.]store (paths /icons/103, /icons/389) and executes the response body via eval(JSON.parse(b)). This gives the remote server arbitrary code execution on any system that requires the module. The C2 host is rest-icon-handler[.]store.",
